1826..1903 Comment "/// The sum commutes (cubical\'s `+Comm`), by induction on the second summand,"
1904..1978 Comment "/// each step the recursive call carried along `up` or `down` and then the"
1979..2056 Comment "/// summand brought out of the left. The arms compose to no conversion of the"
2057..2131 Comment "/// answer at `x`, yet `Int` is a set, so its rules are respected by their"
2132..2152 Comment "/// endpoints alone."
